  "prefLabel": "Jus 415.01 Annual Submission of Community Benefits Plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 415.01 Annual Submission of Community Benefits Plan. Within 90 days of the start of its fiscal year, health care charitable trusts shall complete and submit online Form NHCT-31 “Community Benefits Plan Report,” effective September 2022, available at www.doj.nh.gov/charitable-trusts/forms.htm.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus400.html"
